Homage to the Buddha, the blessed, noble and fully self-awakened one.

7
00:00:52,036 --> 00:00:54,860
Now this evening I have to start with an apology.

8
00:00:55,533 --> 00:01:04,587
The test was flawed and I'm sure that some of you felt humiliated and crushed.

