And it all hangs around this one word because after the after the meditation, it was Noreen pointed out to me that this word personality had never come up in previous talks.

10
00:01:17,947 --> 00:01:19,248
And I don't think it has at all.

11
00:01:19,828 --> 00:01:23,515
So I had to go back and review the situation.

12
00:01:24,507 --> 00:01:32,197
Now, it seems that the word used is , this body.

13
00:01:32,618 --> 00:01:37,406
And one translator actually translated it as embodiment.

14
00:01:37,445 --> 00:01:41,171
What does the word embodiment mean?

15
00:01:41,432 --> 00:01:43,995
