What is the equipment of concentration?

119
00:11:49,394 --> 00:11:51,755
What is the development of concentration?

120
00:11:52,236 --> 00:11:59,985
So this is put in such a sort of quizzical way that I would never put it to you as a test.

121
00:12:00,004 --> 00:12:02,587
It would be crushing and humiliating.

122
00:12:03,309 --> 00:12:11,820
Because you've got to sort of get into the way, the speak, the sort of scriptural speak, how things are put.

123
00:12:13,081 --> 00:12:19,629
So concentration, the word here is eikagata, which means everything going one way, one way.

124
00:12:20,051 --> 00:12:22,514
So the mind, the attention is just going one way.

125
00:12:23,033 --> 00:12:27,480
Here the word that Abikubode has chosen is unification of the mind.

126
00:12:28,301 --> 00:12:31,764
I would prefer attention, unification of attention.

127
00:12:33,144 --> 00:12:38,631
The basis of this concentration are the four foundations of mindfulness.

128
00:12:39,212 --> 00:12:52,250
Now remember that the four foundations of mindfulness on the body, on feelings, mental states, and on all the teaching of the Buddha, the hindrances, the seven facts of enlightenment, the Eightfold Noble Path, etc.

129
00:12:53,851 --> 00:12:59,980
Those four foundations not only are for the meditation, but in ordinary daily life.

130
00:13:00,971 --> 00:13:07,018
So the basis for this concentration is the four foundations of mindfulness.

131
00:13:07,038 --> 00:13:08,219
What is the equipment?

132
00:13:08,339 --> 00:13:13,823
In other words, what do you use in order to get this right concentration?

133
00:13:14,464 --> 00:13:18,908
The four kinds of right effort or striving is put here, the padana.

134
00:13:19,788 --> 00:13:30,438
So remember that is, if I get confused with this now, if an unwholesome habit arises, we then, you know,

135
00:13:30,672 --> 00:13:35,836
just get onto it ASAP and not get involved in it.

136
00:13:36,477 --> 00:13:41,423
And we stop further arisings of these unwholesome states.

137
00:13:42,203 --> 00:13:48,971
When a wholesome state arises, we develop it and we try to maintain it.

138
00:13:49,692 --> 00:13:51,332
Those are your four great strivings.

139
00:13:53,576 --> 00:13:56,639
Now, what is the development of concentration?

140
00:13:57,259 --> 00:13:58,941
Ah, repetition.

141
00:13:59,274 --> 00:14:02,779
development and cultivation of these same states.

142
