146
00:14:19,441 --> 00:14:32,962
uh, you're always eating at the same time, sleeping at the same, everything is, and this, this repetition, it comes to the wisdom to it because there you see how the mind always wants to enjoy itself.

147
00:14:33,023 --> 00:14:34,365
It always wants to indulge.

148
00:14:34,426 --> 00:14:36,008
It wants to do something else.

149
00:14:36,568 --> 00:14:37,330
Yeah.

150
00:14:37,370 --> 00:14:41,837
And repetition is, is it just a way of calming the whole process?

151
00:14:43,059 --> 00:14:43,760
So, uh,

