00:14:44,466 --> 00:15:11,823
repetition in concentration as such that's why we watch the breath you know if you said to somebody any person in the street you know i i watched the breath for an hour they'd say well you must be nuts i mean what would you do that for it's completely boring but for for the meditator this is how we get this unification of the mind you see this unification of attention and of course that comes with it the peacefulness and that sense of inner joy

153
00:15:13,322 --> 00:15:15,385
So that's your right concentration.

154
00:15:16,027 --> 00:15:17,369
