167
00:15:57,860 --> 00:15:59,261
Volitional formation habits.

168
00:16:00,604 --> 00:16:04,990
In breathing and out breathing are the bodily formation.

169
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:10,076
Applied thoughts and sustained thoughts are the verbal formation.

170
00:16:11,178 --> 00:16:13,501
Perception and feeling are the mental

171
00:16:13,684 --> 00:16:34,342
formation ah now but why are in breathing and out breathing the bodily formation why are applied thoughts and sustained thoughts the verbal formation right so it's thinking yeah why are perception and feeling the mental formation friend visaka

172
00:16:34,828 --> 00:16:36,932
In breathing and out breathing are bodily.

173
00:16:37,332 --> 00:16:39,576
These are states bound up with the body.

174
00:16:40,758 --> 00:16:47,807
So any action which includes the body, such as me waving about like this, those are bodily formations.

175
00:16:50,432 --> 00:16:52,254
And that's why it's called a bodily formation.

176
00:16:52,274 --> 00:17:02,490
Now, first one applies thought and sustains thought, and subsequently one breaks out in speech.

177
00:17:03,061 --> 00:17:17,744
that is why applied thought and sustained thought are a verbal formation now the reason why this is interesting is because often the second step of the eightfold path right

