00:17:52,166 --> 00:18:22,089
that that right attitude or right intention is uh is something which sits within us as a way of expressing wisdom into the world right that's why it's not it's put as these it's normally the examples that they give is from um from selfishness to generosity or through renunciation to generosity from hatred to love and from cruelty to compassion so these are attitudes

